1
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,170
Huh? Kaede-san?

2
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:07,210
(Can we talk for a moment?)

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,340
I'm sorry about last time.

4
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,720
Oh? What do you mean?

5
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,220
The day you...

6
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,730
said I should be the one
playing Viola.

7
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:21,230
I was pretty rude to you.

8
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,110
No, not at all.

9
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:24,820
It was my fault.

10
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,780
I didn't consider your feelings, Kaede-san.

11
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,360
Besides,

12
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,280
when I think about it,

13
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,700
I don't have the luxury
to worry about others.

14
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,370
Huh?

15
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:36,080
I need to focus on myself first.

16
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:38,160
I'm going to do my best

17
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,960
in my own way.

18
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:41,330
Yeah.

19
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:43,840
To be honest,

20
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,840
I was really frustrated.

21
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:47,960
But

22
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:48,800
after seriously looking at

23
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,550
your performance as Viola,

24
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:51,890
I finally understand

25
00:00:51,890 --> 00:00:53,010
why Haru chose you.

26
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:55,350
What do you mean?

27
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:57,430
Try to picture

28
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:59,570
the person you love in your mind.

29
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,600
Isn't that what Haru said?

30
00:01:01,850 --> 00:01:04,360
Try to picture

31
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:05,610
the person you love in your mind.

32
00:01:06,230 --> 00:01:07,230
Yes.

33
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:08,900
I see.

34
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,360
Huh!?

35
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:11,820
What do you mean?

36
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:14,120
Minato,

37
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:16,330
you like Haru, don't you?
